  "description": "A Blazor camera component built on getUserMedia. Full screen viewfinder, front/back switch,\n\t\t\ttorch, zoom presets and JPEG capture, with no opinion about what you do with the photo:\n\t\t\tevery application concern (upload, storage quota, localization, notifications) is a parameter\n\t\t\tor a callback. Icons, texts, controls and overlays are fully customizable.",
