  "releaseNotes": "Fix: photos matched the viewfinder again. The frame rate floor introduced with the sharp photos change\n\t\t\twas applied with applyConstraints on its own, and applyConstraints replaces every constraint on the\n\t\t\ttrack instead of adding to it: the requested frame size was dropped, the browser switched to another\n\t\t\tformat (square on some Android phones) and the photo stopped matching what the preview showed, in\n\t\t\tportrait and in landscape alike. The floor now restates the same resolution the stream was opened with.",
